mer+architectures%22+OR+%22foundation+model%22+OR+%22foundation+models%22+OR+%22LLM+agent%22+OR+%22LLM+agents%22+OR+%22language+agent%22+OR+%22language+agents%22+OR+agentic+OR+%22vision+language+model%22+OR+%22vision+language+models%22+OR+%22vision-language+model%22+OR+%22vision-language+models%22+OR+%22multimodal+model%22+OR+%22multimodal+models%22+OR+%22multi-modal+model%22+OR+%22multi-modal+models%22+OR+%22multimodal+learning%22+OR+%22diffusion+model%22+OR+%22diffusion+models%22+OR+%22world+model%22+OR+%22world+models%22+OR+%22mixture+of+experts%22+OR+%22mixture-of-experts%22%29%29"}}